<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19789" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βελτ-ίων</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, gen.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ονος</span>, 
			Comp. of
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγαθός</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>better</i> (not in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βέλτιόν [ἐστι</span>] <i>it
				is fitting, conuenient</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1264b28
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μανθάνειν βελτίονα</span> [<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>]<i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				1120.5
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τὸ β. χωρεῖν</span>
			<i>improve, advance</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.50
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τὸ β. ἐλθεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Din.
					1.65
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγειν</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				29
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ βελτίω προσδοκᾶν ἀεί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Apollod.Com.
					9
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βελτιόνως, ἔχειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Mul.</u>
					1.2
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				484a
			</span></i>. [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑ</span>
			
				Att.
			, but 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βέλτῐον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Mimn.
					2.10
				</span></i>
			.]</div>
